        "text": "#### **Candidate [14]: Microsoft unveils Maia 300 custom AI inference chip**\n* **What is confirmed:** Microsoft officially announced the **Maia 300**, its third-generation custom AI accelerator built on TSMC’s N2P process node with HBM4 memory"
